---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — Junwon Lee"
  description="Junwon Lee — MS student at IRIS Lab, Sungkyunkwan University. Training-free acceleration of diffusion LLMs, KV-cache compression, quantization, and efficient inference systems."
  jsonLd={{
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'Person',
    name: 'Junwon Lee',
    alternateName: '이준원',
    url: 'https://romaanj.github.io/about/',
    email: 'jwlee1218@g.skku.edu',
    affiliation: {
      '@type': 'Organization',
      name: 'IRIS Lab, Sungkyunkwan University',
      url: 'https://iris.skku.edu/',
    },
    alumniOf: 'Sungkyunkwan University',
    sameAs: [
      'https://github.com/Romaanj',
      'https://www.linkedin.com/in/junwon-lee-961383204/',
      'https://iris.skku.edu/authors/m29_junwon_lee/',
    ],
    knowsAbout: ['diffusion LLMs', 'KV-cache compression', 'quantization', 'efficient inference'],
  }}
>
  <!-- hero -->
  <section class="section hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">About me</p>
        <h1>Hi, I'm Junwon.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          <span class="lang-en">
            M.S. student at IRIS Lab, Sungkyunkwan University, working on
            efficient inference for large models.
          </span>
          <span class="lang-ko">
            성균관대학교 IRIS Lab 석사과정. 대형 모델의 효율적인 추론을 연구합니다.
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- decorative monogram (no photo, on purpose) -->
      <div class="monogram-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg class="monogram" viewBox="0 0 240 240" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img">
          <rect x="4" y="4" width="232" height="232" rx="24" class="mg-ground" />
          <!-- quarter-circle, coral -->
          <path d="M 236 236 L 236 140 A 96 96 0 0 0 140 236 Z" class="mg-coral" />
          <!-- small geometric friends -->
          <circle cx="52" cy="188" r="14" class="mg-olive" />
          <path d="M 178 44 L 206 92 L 150 92 Z" class="mg-kraft" />
          <!-- serif initials -->
          <text x="46" y="132" class="mg-letters">JL</text>
          <!-- roofline: bandwidth slope meeting the compute ceiling -->
          <path d="M 46 158 L 118 150 L 194 150" class="mg-roofline" />
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- bio -->
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          <span class="lang-en">
            I'm interested in the intersection of AI and hardware —
            <strong>training-free acceleration</strong> of diffusion LLMs,
            KV-cache compression and quantization, and hardware-software
            co-optimization. I try to measure first and propose methods second.
          </span>
          <span class="lang-ko">
            AI와 hardware의 교차점에 관심이 있습니다 — diffusion LLM의
            <strong>training-free 가속</strong>, KV-cache 압축·quantization,
            그리고 hardware-software co-optimization. 측정을 먼저 하고 method는
            그다음에 제안하려 합니다.
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <p class="interest-tags">
        <span class="tag">Diffusion LLMs</span>
        <span class="tag">KV-cache compression</span>
        <span class="tag">Quantization</span>
        <span class="tag">Hybrid attention</span>
        <span class="tag">GPU systems</span>
        <span class="tag">HW-SW co-optimization</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- background -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Background</p>
      <h2>A short timeline</h2>
      <ol class="timeline">
        <li>
          <span class="tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div class="tl-body">
            <span class="tl-when">2026–Present</span>
            <h3>M.S. student — IRIS Lab, Sungkyunkwan University</h3>
            <p>Advised by Prof. Jong Hwan Ko.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div class="tl-body">
            <span class="tl-when">2020–2026</span>
            <h3>B.S. — Electronic and Electrical Engineering, Sungkyunkwan University</h3>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- awards -->
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Awards</p>
      <h2>
        <span class="lang-en">Honors &amp; awards</span>
        <span class="lang-ko">수상</span>
      </h2>
      <ul class="awards-list">
        <li>
          <span class="aw-when">2024</span>
          <span class="aw-body">
            <span class="lang-en">Dean's List — College of Information and Communication Engineering, SKKU (Fall 2024)</span>
            <span class="lang-ko">Dean's List — 성균관대학교 정보통신대학 (2024-2학기)</span>
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="aw-when">2023</span>
          <span class="aw-body">
            <span class="lang-en">Dean's List — College of Information and Communication Engineering, SKKU (Fall 2023)</span>
            <span class="lang-ko">Dean's List — 성균관대학교 정보통신대학 (2023-2학기)</span>
          </span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- contact -->
  <section class="section-tight contact">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="contact-row">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
          <h2>Say hello</h2>
          <p class="contact-note">
            Happy to talk about efficient inference, diffusion LLMs, or GPU
            systems — 커피챗 환영합니다.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-actions">
          <a class="btn" href="mailto:jwlee1218@g.skku.edu">Email me</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="https://github.com/Romaanj" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub — Romaanj</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="https://iris.skku.edu/authors/m29_junwon_lee/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IRIS Lab profile</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/junwon-lee-961383204/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
          <a class="arrow-link" href="/study/">See what I'm studying</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>

  .interest-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.45rem; margin: 1.1rem 0 0; }
  .awards-list { list-style: none; margin: 1.2rem 0 0; padding: 0; }
  .awards-list li { display: flex; gap: 0.9em; padding: 0.4rem 0; font-size: 0.97rem; }
  .aw-when { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-tertiary); padding-top: 0.15em; min-width: 3em; }
  .hero { padding-top: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 7rem); }
  .hero h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--accent-strong);
  }
  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 250px;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .lede { margin-top: 1.6rem; }

  /* monogram */
  .monogram-wrap { justify-self: end; }
  .monogram {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 250px;
  }
  .mg-ground {
    fill: var(--surface-warm);
    stroke: var(--line);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .mg-coral { fill: var(--accent); }
  .mg-olive { fill: var(--swatch-olive); }
  .mg-kraft { fill: var(--swatch-kraft); }
  .mg-letters {
    font-family: 'Source Serif 4 Variable', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 92px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--text);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .mg-roofline {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--accent-strong);
    stroke-width: 4;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  /* warm band for values */
  .band-warm {
    background: var(--surface-warm);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .band-warm h2 { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .values .card h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; }

  /* timeline */
  .timeline {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 2.2rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    position: relative;
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .timeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 7px;
    top: 6px;
    bottom: 6px;
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--line);
  }
  .timeline li {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0 0 2.2rem 2.2rem;
  }
  .timeline li:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }
  .tl-dot {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.35rem;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }
  .timeline li:first-child .tl-dot { background: var(--accent); }
  .tl-when {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent-strong);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }
  .tl-body h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }
  .tl-body p { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--text) 72%, transparent); max-width: 60ch; }

  /* contact */
  .contact-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }
  .contact-note {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--text) 72%, transparent);
    max-width: 42ch;
  }
  .contact-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .monogram-wrap { justify-self: start; }
    .monogram { max-width: 180px; }
  }
</style>
